  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/60947872), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%97%BC%EB%9D%BC%EC%9D%98-%EC%88%A8%EA%B2%B0/3374)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/156308)\n\nJoo-Young Kim slipped on an icy road and died an absurd death.\n\n'I've been living so hard... it's too much to die like this\n\nIt's unfair!' Even the grim reaper felt sorry for her death and found a way to live.\n\ntells\n\n\"You can live if you receive the breath of the next King Yeomra, who is currently in this world.\" \"Receiving breath...?\" \"There's a better way, right? A kiss!\"\n\nIf you want to live, kiss the Great King of Yeomra! Will Joo-yeong be able to receive the breath of Hae-in, the prickly boss of Yeomra the Great?",
